 history and internal review notes.\", \"approving_officer_signature\": \"MW\", \"reporting_officer_signature\": \"AT\", \"reporting_officer_designation\": \"Compliance Analyst\", \"date_of_birth_or_incorporation\": \"2022-08-15\"}'),(10,22,3,NULL,'STR-2026-22-1784631766016','Suspicious Transaction Report Draft\n\nCASE SUMMARY\nAlert ID: 22\nTransaction ID: TXN-TC-038\nAlert risk level: High\nAlert risk score: 65\nPriority: High\nAlert message: +30 Significant amount compared to merchant average: Transaction amount exceeded the applicable merchant or MCC threshold, +20 Daily transaction value spike: Daily transaction value exceeded merchant or MCC baseline, +15 Merchant MCC risk points: MCC risk points applied: Money transfer / remittance\n\nTRIGGERED RULES\n1. Significant amount compared to merchant average - [object Object]\n2. Daily transaction value spike - [object Object]\n3. Merchant MCC risk points - [object Object]\n\nTRANSACTION DETAILS\nAmount: SGD 50000.00\nTransaction type: online\nPayment method: PayNow\nPayment reference: PAY-DVALUE-001\nTerminal ID: Not recorded\nIP address: 103.18.17.1\nTransaction country: Singapore\nTransaction time: 2026-07-20T05:00:00.000Z\nTransaction status: success\n\nMERCHANT PROFILE\nMerchant ID: DEMO-MONEY-HIGH-001\nMerchant name: Demo QuickRemit Money Transfer\nBusiness category: Money transfer / remittance\nMCC code: 4829\nMerchant risk level: High\nMerchant risk score: 60\nMerchant average amount: 1000.00\nMerchant country: Singapore\nMerchant status: active\nOperating hours: 09:00:00 to 20:00:00\n\nRFI AND INVESTIGATION CONTEXT\nRFI reference: No RFI linked\nRFI status: Not recorded\nRequested documents: Not recorded\nRequest message: Not recorded\nAnalyst RFI remarks: Not recorded\nMerchant response: No merchant response recorded\nResponse attachment: Not recorded\nRFI sent at: Not recorded\nRFI due at: Not recorded\nRFI responded at: Not recorded\n\nANALYST ASSESSMENT\nNo additional escalation remarks provided.\n\nCASE ACTIVITY BEFORE ESCALATION\n1. alert created | Status: Pending | Remarks: +30 Significant amount compared to merchant average: Transaction amount exceeded the applicable merchant or MCC threshold, +20 Daily transaction value spike: Daily transaction value exceeded merchant or MCC baseline, +15 Merchant MCC risk points: MCC risk points applied: Money transfer / remittance | Recorded: 2026-07-19T09:01:22.000Z\n\nRECOMMENDATION\nThe analyst escalated this case for STRO review based on the recorded risk indicators and investigation context. This draft was created and submitted to the STRO queue as part of the same escalation action.','approved_by_stro','2026-07-21 11:02:45','2026-07-21 11:48:46','2026-07-21 11:48:46',NULL,NULL,1,'2026-07-21 11:48:46',NULL),(11,24,3,NULL,'STR-2026-1497','Suspicious Transaction Report Draft\n\nREPORTING ENTITY\nReporting entity: Republic Trust Bank Ltd\nEntity type: Not recorded\nUEN: 202612345N\nBusiness address: 1 Marina Boulevard, #20-01, Singapore 018989\nCompliance officer: Daniel Lim\nCompliance email: daniel.lim@rtbank.com.sg\nCompliance contact: +65 9123 4567\n\nSUBJECT / MERCHANT\nSubject name: Chan Wei Ming\nMerchant name: Chan Chinatown Hawker Stall\nMerchant ID: DEMO-MONEY-HIGH-001\nBusiness type: Food and Beverage Merchant\nIdentification number: 202245678K\nAccount number: RTB-8392014756\nNationality: Singapore\nSubject address: 335 Smith Street, #02-123, Chinatown Complex, Singapore 050335\nSubject contact: +65 9876 4321\n\nTRANSACTION\nTransaction ID: TXN-TC-040\nAmount: 9850.00\nCurrency: SGD\nDate/time: 2026-07-20T10:34\nPayment method: Not recorded\nChannel: Not recorded\nStatus: Completed\nOriginating country: Singapore\nDestination country: Singapore\nSource of funds: Multiple third-party transfers with no clear connection to the merchant\'s normal food and beverage sales.\nDestination of funds: Beneficiary account held by Apex Global Trading Pte Ltd, account 987-654-321.\n\nINVESTIGATION\nDetection method: Automated Transaction Monitoring System\nRisk level: Medium\nRisk score: 45\nRisk indicators: Not recorded\nOther risk indicators: The transaction value was significantly higher than the merchant\'s normal daily sales and was followed by rapid onward movement of funds.\nInvestigation findings: The analyst reviewed the merchant profile, recent transaction history, KYC records and system-generated alerts.\r\n\r\nThe merchant normally receives low-value retail payments below SGD 500. The reviewed transaction of SGD 9,850.00 was substantially above the normal range. No invoice, business contract or clear commercial reason was available to explain the payment.\r\n\r\nThe funds were subsequently transferred to an unrelated company shortly after receipt. The activity is inconsistent with the stated business profile and presents an elevated money laundering risk.\nSupporting documents: Not recorded\nOther supporting evidence: Transaction monitoring screenshots, merchant risk profile, alert history and internal review notes.\nOther actions taken: The account was placed under enhanced monitoring and the case was escalated to the STRO for review.\n\nRECOMMENDATION\nRecommended action: File STR\nRecommendation remarks: File an STR because the transaction is unusually large, inconsistent with the merchant profile and lacks a clear economic purpose.\nEscalated to: Michael Wong, STRO\n\nSTR NARRATIVE\nSuspicious Transaction Report Draft\r\n\r\nREPORTING ENTITY\r\nReporting entity: Republic Trust Bank Ltd\r\nEntity type: Bank\r\nUEN: 202612345N\r\nBusiness address: 1 Marina Boulevard, #20-01, Singapore 018989\r\nCompliance officer: Daniel Lim\r\nCompliance email: daniel.lim@rtbank.com.sg\r\nCompliance contact: +65 9123 4567\r\n\r\nSUBJECT / MERCHANT\r\nSubject name: Chan Wei Ming\r\nMerchant name: Chan Chinatown Hawker Stall\r\nMerchant ID: DEMO-MONEY-HIGH-001\r\nBusiness type: Food and Beverage Merchant\r\nIdentification number: 202245678K\r\nAccount number: RTB-8392014756\r\nNationality: